%N A086891 Denominator of 3 * sqrt(2) * (Integral_{x=0..1} (1+x^2)^((2n-1)/2) dx - ((2n-1)!! / (2n)!!}) * arsinh(1) ).
%F A086891 a(n) = denominator(6*r(n)) where r(0)=0 and r(n) = 2^(n-2)/n + ((2*n-1) / (2*n)) * r(n-1). - _Sean A. Irvine_, Oct 15 2026
%t A086891 a[n_] := Denominator[ 3Simplify[ Sqrt[2]((Integrate[(1 + x^2)^((2n - 1)/2), {x, 0, 1}]) - (2n - 1)!!ArcSinh[1]/(2n)!!)]]; Table[ a[n], {n, 1, 21}] (* _Robert G. Wilson v_, Feb 27 2004 *)
